Neo Identity - Krea 2 Identity Edit V2 for Forge Neo
Copyright 2026 RJSprod

This extension is a port of the Krea 2 Identity Edit inference recipe:

  ComfyUI-Krea2Edit (https://github.com/lbouaraba/comfyui-krea2edit)
  Copyright conradlocke / lbouaraba, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The edit forward's token sequence and placement, the fit and crop reference
  geometry, the grounded encoding and the attention boost's semantics are
  reimplemented from its __init__.py (v2.0.0, commit 13ef60f).

  krea2edit-trainer (https://github.com/lbouaraba/krea2edit-trainer)
  Apache License, Version 2.0. Its docs/GEOMETRY.md is the geometry contract
  the fixtures in tests/test_geometry.py are worked from.

The tests apply the rotary embedding as FLUX does
(https://github.com/black-forest-labs/flux, Apache License, Version 2.0) in
place of the host's comfy-kitchen kernel.

The extension runs inside SD WebUI Forge Neo
(https://github.com/Haoming02/sd-webui-forge-classic, branch neo, AGPL-3.0)
and calls its classes at runtime; none of its source is copied here. The tests
read the host's own files from a checkout the user points them at.

The Krea 2 model and the Krea 2 Identity Edit LoRA weights are distributed
separately under their own terms (the Krea 2 Community License and the terms on
https://huggingface.co/conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit) and are not part of
this repository.
